<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: I''m not sure I''d call this sort of mountain hiking a "trivial pursuit", actually, but based on what I''m seeing in the challenge a LOT of people think worthwhile, healthy, active things qualify as "trivial" :-) Anyway, it''s a lovely place/picture, Margaret. I wish I were well enough to do this :-(   I agree - but these challenges always garner shoehorns, because a real trivial pursuit would bring about a boring photo IMHO. That''s why I try to avoid these challenges like the plague. ', '2022-06-22 02:46:03.000000', NULL, 0),
